+                # (segment_pages < 0) is work-tile-invariant (affine params are
+                # loaded once per work-tile), so branch on the uniform predicate
+                # instead of computing BOTH the affine candidate and the
+                # mResolvedPageTableRow[n_block] load then selecting. Affine
+                # rows skip the per-n-block row LDG entirely; sentinel
+                # (irregular) rows skip the wasted affine arithmetic.
+                if segment_pages < 0:
